cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the repository revision when using this independent experimental
  implementation. Cite the ScientistTwo paper separately for the original method.
title: Open-ScientistTwo
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: Open-ScientistTwo contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/duyvuleo/Open-ScientistTwo
url: https://github.com/duyvuleo/Open-ScientistTwo
abstract: >-
  An unofficial experimental implementation of a persistent, auditable research
  workflow inspired by ScientistTwo, with offline scripted agents, isolated
  experiments, task adapters, and optional live agents and PaperOrchestra writing.
references:
  - type: article
    title: "ScientistTwo: Pioneering the Human Knowledge Frontier with Autonomous AI"
